ROVED","SubmissionId":"htaczv17rtgxd7udk93wzz6wt","SubmissionTime":"2019-04-02T21:40:46.000+00:00","ReviewText":"This grill does it all! I have done everything from smoke, to braise, to baking desserts and sourdough bread on it. The incredibly accurate temperatures make this a must have product. The WIFIRE\u00AE tech means I can run errands, or take my daughter to swim class and monitor and change temperatures. The temperature recovery is so quick, and it gets hotter, faster! I love my Pro 780 and use it almost every day! It's so versatile and performs well with every type of cooking.","Title":"Fantastic All Around","UserNickname":"Mandy T.","ContextDataValues":{"Age":{"Value":"35to44","Id":"Age"},"Gender":{"Value":"Female","Id":"Gender"},"IncentivizedReview":{"Value":"True","Id":"IncentivizedReview"}},"InappropriateFeedbackList":[],"IsSyndicated":false,"Cons":null,"ProductRecommendationIds":[],"TagDimensions":{},"RatingRange":5,"Videos":[],"AdditionalFields":{},"AdditionalFieldsOrder":[],"Pros":null,"SecondaryRatingsOrder":[],"CommentIds":[],"ClientResponses":[],"TagDimensionsOrder":[],"SecondaryRatings":{}},{"Id":"217179140","CID":"4763f5d9-7392-5bce-ba9e-209a665b1048","SourceClient":"traegerservice","Badges":{"incentivizedReview":{"ContentType":"REVIEW","Id":"incentivizedReview","BadgeType":"Custom"}},"BadgesOrder":["incentivizedReview"],"LastModeratedTime":"2019-04-03T16:15:13.000+00:00","LastModificationTime":"2019-04-08T15:55:00.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB78GLE","OriginalProductName":"Pro 780 Pellet Grill - Black - In Store Only","CampaignId":"BV_REVIEW_DISPLAY","ContextDataValuesOrder":["Gender","Age","IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Parker, CO","AuthorId":"lm288ttlwr0kmw86v4qzf8fwf","ContentLocale":"en_US","IsFeatured":false,"TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount":0,"TotalClientResponseCount":0,"TotalCommentCount":0,"Rating":5,"IsRatingsOnly":false,"Helpfulness":1.0,"TotalFeedbackCount":1,"TotalNegativeFeedbackCount":0,"TotalPositiveFeedbackCount":1,"ModerationStatus":"APPROVED","SubmissionId":"tnahohaksxdpcixm69ev4i1hw","SubmissionTime":"2019-04-02T21:23:32.000+00:00","ReviewText":"I previously owned a Texas Elite grill from Traeger, which I have enjoyed. However, this Pro 575 has been even better. \r\n\r\nI love the convenience of the WiFire feature. It was very easy to set up and I am happy that I don't have to go outside to check the temperature anymore (especially on cold mornings). \r\n\r\nThe controller is very intuitive and easy to use as well, and was definitely a nice upgrade for me from my previous grill. \r\n\r\nThis grill gets up to temperature very quickly. Even on a couple of sub-freezing days, I was able to set it to maximum temperature without any issues. \r\n\r\nSo far I have made ribs, nachos, and brisket on this new grill and so far I am so glad that I went with this model. Definitely recommended!","Title":"Great Grill with Top Notch Features","UserNickname":"Daniel","ContextDataValues":{"Age":{"Value":"25to34","Id":"Age"},"IncentivizedReview":{"Value":"True","Id":"IncentivizedReview"},"Gender":{"Value":"Male","Id":"Gender"}},"InappropriateFeedbackList":[],"IsSyndicated":false,"Photos":[],"Cons":null,"ProductRecommendationIds":[],"TagDimensions":{},"IsRecommended":null,"RatingRange":5,"Videos":[],"AdditionalFields":{},"AdditionalFieldsOrder":[],"Pros":null,"SecondaryRatingsOrder":[],"CommentIds":[],"ClientResponses":[],"TagDimensionsOrder":[],"SecondaryRatings":{}},{"Id":"217177160","CID":"88c8e2be-824e-572d-a0ad-1056af570257","SourceClient":"traegerservice","Badges":{"incentivizedReview":{"ContentType":"REVIEW","Id":"incentivizedReview","BadgeType":"Custom"}},"BadgesOrder":["incentivizedReview"],"LastModeratedTime":"2019-04-03T16:15:13.000+00:00","LastModificationTime":"2019-04-18T12:19:57.000+00:00","ProductId":"TFB57GLE","OriginalProductName":"Pro 575 Pellet Grill - Black","CampaignId":"BV_REVIEW_DISPLAY","ContextDataValuesOrder":["Gender","Age","IncentivizedReview"],"UserLocation":"Sandy, UT","Au